      <title>Higher Airfares Are Here to Stay. That’s Not a Bad Thing</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-27/higher-airfares-are-here-to-stay-that-s-not-a-bad-thing</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">f16f4868a152295cb2cdf039</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:00:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>No one wants to pay more to fly, but travel-hungry US passengers are giving airlines little reason to halt price increases. Air travel demand is holding up and encouraging carriers to raise fares faster and further to make up for soaring jet fuel costs. Once up, prices will likely stay there even after the energy crunch subsides.</description>
