    <item>
      <title>Cockroach Cleantech Is Flipping the Script on Fossil Fuels</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-10-27/cockroach-cleantech-is-flipping-the-script-on-fossil-fuels</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b287a0b5013fd7d6ca16084e</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:30:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Despite the mass extinction event known as the second Trump administration, cleantech lives. Renewable energy deployment is breaking records, even in the US, and more than one-in-four of every new passenger vehicle sold worldwide now sports a socket. This reflects two things. First, neither President Donald Trump nor the US, powerful as they are, can negate basic scientific and economic forces. Second, Trump’s own actions have strengthened those forces.</description>
